**Fixture Refactor Context**

Application fixtures have recently been reorganized and streamlined for reuse, rather than recreating them for every single test. This is an ongoing effort. The goal is to remove all blackbox testing with MagicMocks.

Massive changes were introduced as a result of Phase 07.04. Many of the unit tests are failing as a result. Rather than simply getting the old tests to work in the new "Material" framework (which now includes HitboxSchema), the entire Fixture framework is being condense to reduce boilerplate even further. In the current phase, Fixture Factories are being integrated into the test pipeline. 

